<title>USA: U.S. DEIP nonfat dry milk to Caribbean, Latam.</title>
<headline>U.S. DEIP nonfat dry milk to Caribbean, Latam.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said it accepted the following bid or bids under the Dairy Export Incentive Program:</p>
<p>Product: nonfat dry milk</p>
<p>Quantity: 96 tonnes</p>
<p>Destination: Caribbean, Central and South America</p>
<p>Delivery: Nov 1 - Dec 31</p>
<p>Bonus: $810 per tonne</p>
<p>Exporter: P.S. International Ltd</p>
<p>DEIP balance (Caribbean, Central and South America) 49,694 tonnes</p>
</text>
